      "x": 880,
      "y": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "text": "1)  เปิดแท็บ PORTS (แถวเดียวกับ TERMINAL)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-10T16:33:29.545Z",
