    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 178,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "text": "2)  กดปุ่ม Forward a Port",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-10T16:33:29.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-10T16:33:29.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 216,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "text": "3)  พิมพ์เลข port ของแล็บ เช่น 8080 แล้วกด Enter",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-10T16:33:29.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-10T16:33:29.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 254,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "text": "4)  เปิด http://localhost:8080 ในเบราว์เซอร์",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
